15. Scoring tables and colours replaced - games/bug-column/, games/blast-maze/
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Both games were rebuilt on 9 September 2026 and the two things that could be
read as taken from the arcade games of the same genre were replaced.

games/bug-column/ used to award 100 points for a crawler head and 300 for the
flanking spider - the same figures the 1980 arcade original used. The table is
now this project's own: 20 points per body segment, 75 for a head, 8 for a
destroyed pod, 180 plus 20 per wave for the spider, and 150 plus 50 per wave
for clearing a wave. The field's look was moved away from the original's red
and white mushrooms on black as well: the pods are drawn in the collection's
